{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49006","headline":"僊都山留题 · 刘昭禹","name":"僊都山留题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林下事无非，尘中竟不知。\n白云深拥我，青石合眠谁。\n山静捣灵药，夜闲论古诗。\n此来亲羽客，何日变枯髭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘昭禹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}